<article class="worlds-beyond wb-roll-card">
  <header><h3>{{label}}</h3><span class="wb-roll-mode">{{modeLabel}}</span></header>
  {{#if success}}<p class="wb-roll-success">Success · Defy Fate</p>{{/if}}
  {{{rollHTML}}}
  {{#if defense}}
    {{#if defense.incoming}}<p class="wb-roll-note">{{defense.incoming.attackerName}} · {{defense.incoming.weaponName}}{{#if defense.incoming.targetName}} → {{defense.incoming.targetName}}{{/if}}</p>{{/if}}
    {{#if defense.parry}}
      {{#if defense.hasTarget}}<p>Against attack total {{defense.target}}.</p>{{/if}}
      {{#if defense.resolved}}
        {{#if defense.success}}
          <p class="wb-roll-success">Parried · {{#if defense.overwhelmingForce}}half damage minimum{{else}}no damage{{/if}}</p>
        {{else}}<p class="wb-result">Hit · Parry failed</p>{{/if}}
      {{else}}<p class="wb-result">Compare with the attack total</p>{{/if}}
      <p class="wb-roll-note">{{#if defense.reroll}}Original: {{/if}}{{#if defense.spent}}1 reaction{{#if defense.combatId}} · round {{defense.round}}{{/if}}{{else}}Practice · no reaction{{/if}}</p>
      {{#unless defense.unlocked}}<p class="wb-warning">DEX 21 not reached.</p>{{/unless}}
      {{#unless defense.armed}}<p class="wb-warning">No held weapon or shield.</p>{{/unless}}
      <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>Parry details</summary><p>Beat the attack total; a tie fails. A successful Parry negates damage and non-magical effects.{{#if defense.overwhelmingForce}} Overwhelming Force keeps damage at half or more.{{/if}} Apply Health and effect changes manually.</p>{{#if defense.reroll}}<p>Wonder spends no additional reaction or Parry use.</p>{{/if}}</details>
    {{else}}
    {{#if defense.hasTarget}}<p>Against {{#if defense.area}}area save DC{{else}}attack total{{/if}} {{defense.target}}.</p>{{/if}}
    {{#if defense.resolved}}
      {{#if defense.success}}
        <p class="wb-roll-success">{{#if defense.area}}Saved · half damage{{else}}Dodged · no damage{{/if}}</p>
      {{else}}
        <p class="wb-result">{{#if defense.area}}Failed save · full damage{{else}}Hit · Dodge failed{{/if}}</p>
      {{/if}}
    {{else}}
      <p class="wb-result">Compare with the {{#if defense.area}}save DC{{else}}attack total{{/if}}</p>
    {{/if}}
    <p class="wb-roll-note">{{#if defense.reroll}}Original: {{/if}}{{#if defense.spent}}1 reaction{{else}}Practice · no reaction{{/if}}</p>
    {{#if defense.overriddenDisadvantage}}<p class="wb-warning">Heavy armor · disadvantage overridden.</p>{{/if}}
    <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>Dodge details</summary><p>{{#if defense.area}}Meet or beat the save DC to halve damage before Resistance and Armor Rating.{{else}}Beat the attack total to avoid all damage; a tie fails.{{/if}} Apply Health changes manually.</p>{{#if defense.reroll}}<p>Wonder spends no additional reaction.</p>{{/if}}</details>
    {{/if}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if note}}<p class="wb-roll-note">{{note}}</p>{{/if}}
</article>
